  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Chapter 211 does not describe the Gu worm’s resting body shape, size, or color. Fang Yuan names it a rank five expenditure type Gu that is gone after one use, and says that once it is used on a Gu Master it forms a silver triangle tattoo on their chest.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms",
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Used on a Gu Master, it makes their time flow three times as fast, so one day for them is three days condensed into one. Cultivation and primeval essence recovery both run at that threefold pace. The matching cost is lifespan: time at three times speed shrinks life in proportion, down to a third of the original span, and injuries or poisons that worsen with time also advance three times as fast.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later, weighing how to adapt in northern plains, Fang Yuan names third watch Gu as a common way to accelerate his own time, with lifespan shortened in proportion, and rejects using it on himself because Spring Autumn Cicada would also recover three times as fast.",
        "chapters": [
          449
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lifespan-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "To speed the white-eyes wolf’s growth he uses third watch Gu on it. The wolf’s appetite rises to about thirteen times that of ordinary water wolves, and its lifespan shortens.",
        "chapters": [
          453
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lifespan-cost",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
