  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing kill the demonic Gu Master Chen Cui Hua, Fang Yuan recognizes a silver triangle tattoo on her chest as the mark left by third watch Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "sys_demonic_path",
          "char_chen_cui_hua"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Chen Cui Hua had already used the Gu. Under its mark she cultivated and recovered primeval essence at three times normal speed, which is why her essence recovery in the fight surprised Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing even though she was not a ten extreme physique. She had held her inheritance for less than a year by outside count, but nearly three years by her own time, and green python poison that should have worsened day by day struck her at a three day rate. Bai Ning Bing reads the gift of this Gu as a sign that her inheritance was at least rank five. Fang Yuan treats the Gu as useful to a demonic Gu Master who needs cultivation speed more than long years, and judges Chen Cui Hua against the courage he expects from people who use it, calling her weak and meek.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "case-of-an-earlier-owner",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Later text says the so called universe path is related to time, and that third watch Gu and Spring Autumn Cicada belong to that category, with universe path Gu ranging from rank one to rank five.",
        "chapters": [
          355
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "universe-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_spring_autumn_cicada",
          "gu_universe_path_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Fang Yuan again activates two third watch Gu to accelerate a cocoon by nine times, Feng Tian Yu asks whether he used two time path Gu worms to accelerate time.",
        "chapters": [
          405
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "time-path-wording",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_feng_tian_yu"
        ]
      },
      {
